      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسفهُ</span></b>  (in [some of] the copies of the K,
erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسَفَهُ</span>, TA) <i>He angered him; made</i>
<i>him angry:</i> (S, M, * O, L, Msb, K:) and <i>he
grieved him; made him to grieve,</i> or <i>lament.</i> (M,*
TA.)

